{"id":67459,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67459"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:03:51","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:03:51","slug":"extremo-sul-ultramarathon","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/extremo-sul-ultramarathon\/","title":{"rendered":"Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026<\/strong> realiza-se de <strong>20 a 22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> e desafia-te para uma das travessias pedestres mais extremas e singulares do planeta: percorrer <strong>226 km<\/strong> em formato <em>non-stop<\/em> pela maior extens\u00e3o de praia cont\u00ednua do mundo, no extremo sul do <strong>Brasil<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida no <strong>Chu\u00ed<\/strong> e meta na <strong>Praia do Cassino<\/strong> (Rio Grande do Sul), o percurso linear decorre integralmente sobre o areal atl\u00e2ntico num tempo limite de <strong>52 horas<\/strong>. Em regime de semiautossufici\u00eancia com bases de apoio ao longo da costa, enfrentar\u00e1s areia fofa e compacta, vento forte, neblina, mar\u00e9 alta e zonas de isolamento total.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Horizontes Turismo Desportivo<\/strong> e limitada a um m\u00e1ximo estrito de 80 a 100 atletas, a prova integra o circuito <strong>Tor Experience<\/strong>, atribuindo aos primeiros 10 classificados da geral entradas diretas para o prestigiado <strong>Tor des G\u00e9ants<\/strong>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 a 22 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Praia do Cassino e Chu\u00ed, Chu\u00ed, Rio Grande do Sul, Brasil<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ultramaratona 226 km (Non-Stop, m\u00e1x. 52h)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Horizontes Turismo Desportivo<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/storage\/events\/extremo-sul-ultramarathon-2026\/regulamento_pt_1785843398.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Endurance<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 226K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 20 a 22 Nov<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Early Bird (20 vagas):<\/strong> R$ 2.250<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 esgotar)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 2 (10 vagas):<\/strong> R$ 2.330<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 esgotar)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 3 (10 vagas):<\/strong> R$ 2.420<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 esgotar)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 4 (10 vagas):<\/strong> R$ 2.510<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 esgotar)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 5 (10 vagas):<\/strong> R$ 2.600<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Vagas Extras (at\u00e9 20 vagas):<\/strong> R$ 3.300<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (condicionado)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se de 20 a 22 de novembro de 2026 num percurso linear de 226 km exclusivamente pela praia, ligando o Chu\u00ed \u00e0 Praia do Cassino, no estado do Rio Grande do Sul, Brasil.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e os requisitos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o para participar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite para concluir os 226 km em formato non-stop \u00e9 de 52 horas. Para participar, tens de ter 18 anos completos, apresentar atestado m\u00e9dico e comprovar a conclus\u00e3o de pelo menos uma prova de 100 km ou mais a partir de 2024.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o limite de vagas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento est\u00e1 limitado a 80 vagas base (podendo chegar a 100 com vagas extras). Os valores dividem-se por lotes: Early Bird (R$ 2.250), Lote 2 (R$ 2.330), Lote 3 (R$ 2.420), Lote 4 (R$ 2.510), Lote 5 (R$ 2.600) e Vagas Extras (R$ 3.300), encerrando a 31 de outubro de 2026.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Al\u00e9m de mochila com reserva m\u00ednima de 1,5 L de \u00e1gua, GPS, luz frontal, luz traseira vermelha, manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel e apito, a adenda oficial de 2026 exige o uso de colete refletor no per\u00edodo noturno (18h00 \u00e0s 06h00) e um kit completo de primeiros socorros imperme\u00e1vel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a prova e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da Horizontes Turismo Desportivo. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui transporte de Cassino para a partida no Chu\u00ed, transporte de 2 drop bags, abastecimentos e descanso nas bases de apoio, seguro, medalha de finisher e qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o Tor Experience (Top 10 geral acede ao Tor des G\u00e9ants).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-20\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Praia do Cassino e Chu\u00ed\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Chu\u00ed, Rio Grande do Sul\", \"addressRegion\": \"Brasil\", \"addressCountry\": \"BR\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Horizontes Turismo Desportivo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Extremo Sul Ultramarathon 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se de 20 a 22 de novembro de 2026 num percurso linear de 226 km exclusivamente pela praia, ligando o Chu\u00ed \u00e0 Praia do Cassino, no estado do Rio Grande do Sul, Brasil.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e os requisitos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o para participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite para concluir os 226 km em formato non-stop \u00e9 de 52 horas. Para participar, tens de ter 18 anos completos, apresentar atestado m\u00e9dico e comprovar a conclus\u00e3o de pelo menos uma prova de 100 km ou mais a partir de 2024.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o limite de vagas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento est\u00e1 limitado a 80 vagas base (podendo chegar a 100 com vagas extras). Os valores dividem-se por lotes: Early Bird (R$ 2.250), Lote 2 (R$ 2.330), Lote 3 (R$ 2.420), Lote 4 (R$ 2.510), Lote 5 (R$ 2.600) e Vagas Extras (R$ 3.300), encerrando a 31 de outubro de 2026.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio exigido pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Al\u00e9m de mochila com reserva m\u00ednima de 1,5 L de \u00e1gua, GPS, luz frontal, luz traseira vermelha, manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel e apito, a adenda oficial de 2026 exige o uso de colete refletor no per\u00edodo noturno (18h00 \u00e0s 06h00) e um kit completo de primeiros socorros imperme\u00e1vel.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza a prova e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da Horizontes Turismo Desportivo. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui transporte de Cassino para a partida no Chu\u00ed, transporte de 2 drop bags, abastecimentos e descanso nas bases de apoio, seguro, medalha de finisher e qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o Tor Experience (Top 10 geral acede ao Tor des G\u00e9ants).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70165,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,622],"event_type_2":[1069,1530],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67459","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-chui-rio-grande-do-sul-brasil","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-endurance","event_type_2-america","event_type_2-brasil"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-extremo-sul-ultramarathon.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67459","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=67459"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67459\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70170,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67459\/revisions\/70170"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70165"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=67459"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=67459"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=67459"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=67459"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=67459"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=67459"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=67459"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}